OL,3,GNEWSANo site found yet for town centre
OL,4,APost Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town centre Post Office is set to
OL,7,Fclose in the coming months, with no
OL,8,Freplacement location yet secured.
OL,10,FThe branch inside TG Jones, in
OL,11,FBracknell's Princess Square, will shut
OL,12,Fshortly before the store closes in
OL,13,FJanuary 2027 as part of the retailer's
OL,14,Frestructuring plans.
OL,16,FPost Office said it was in the "early
OL,17,Fstages" of reviewing applications to
OL,18,Frun a replacement branch, but has yet
OL,19,Fto confirm where a new site could be
OL,20,Fbased.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
